---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — Manos for Homes"
	description="How Manos for Homes handles information on this website."
>
	<Header />

	<main class="legal container">
		<p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated: August 20, 2026</p>

		<p>
			Manos for Homes ("we," "us") is a non-profit foundation. This policy explains what information
			this website handles and how. We keep it simple, because our website keeps things simple.
		</p>

		<h2>Information we collect on this website</h2>
		<p>
			This website is informational. It has no user accounts, no forms, and does not itself collect,
			store, or sell your personal information. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.
		</p>
		<p>
			Like nearly every website, our hosting provider may automatically record standard technical
			logs (such as IP addresses and browser type) for security and reliability purposes.
		</p>

		<h2>Donations</h2>
		<p>
			Donations are processed by third-party payment platforms, not by this website. When you
			donate, the information you provide (such as your name, email, and payment details) is
			collected and handled by the donation platform under its own privacy policy, which we
			encourage you to review. We receive donor information from the platform only as needed to
			acknowledge gifts and issue receipts, and we do not sell or rent donor information.
		</p>

		<h2>Links to other sites</h2>
		<p>
			Our site links to third-party sites — such as Instagram and our partners' websites. Those
			sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control.
		</p>

		<h2>Children's privacy</h2>
		<p>
			Our website is a general-audience site and does not knowingly collect personal information
			from children.
		</p>

		<h2>Photos</h2>
		<p>
			Photos on this site show our volunteers, team, and community events, and are used with
			permission. If you appear in a photo and would like it removed, contact us and we will take
			it down promptly.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p>
			If our practices change — for example, if we add a newsletter or contact form — we will update
			this policy and the date above.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact us</h2>
		<p>
			Questions about this policy or your information? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@manosforhomes.org">info@manosforhomes.org</a> or reach us on Instagram at <a href="https://www.instagram.com/project_manosforhomes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@project_manosforhomes</a>.
		</p>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	.container {
		width: min(760px, 92%);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.legal {
		padding: 3.5rem 0 4.5rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		font-family: 'Baloo 2', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.25em;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--red);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	h1 {
		color: var(--blue-deep);
		font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
	}

	.updated {
		color: #5a7089;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}

	h2 {
		color: var(--blue-dark);
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem;
	}

	p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
	}
</style>
